    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. L/480 sounds safer i guess. about the timber—you mentioned knots and defects, but are there any other types of internal issues or \"hidden\" stuff that might not be super obvious on the surface? like things that might cause a beam to fail unexpectedly even if the outside looks okay?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
