      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. it's a bit nerve-wracking though, thinking about stuff like rot or fiber kinks that you can't even see until it's too late. does it ever happen where there's just some weird, unpredictable 'character' to the wood that makes it act up or behave differently than the math says it should?",
